      "content": "thanks. i see the score is at 14 for this batch. we really need to be much more exhaustive to satisfy the audit requirements—even the extremely minor details. \n\nif you can break those down into much smaller individual steps, that would help. basically, instead of one bullet for a whole test, break it down into every single micro-action or sub-check involved. the higher the bullet count, the more \"coverage\" the script sees. \n\ncan you expand this list significantly? try to get the score way higher by being as granular as possible.",
